{"unit_id":"fountunt__dsh-session-cleaner#card-zh","repo":"fountunt/dsh-session-cleaner","commit":"f12ef7bad873638721b5b9891700d2c5e4df22f7","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-session-cleaner 是面向 DSH Web 的会话清理插件，通过 Web 服务注册删除 API，并在侧边栏会话行菜单加入删除入口。它会校验会话编号，处理关联 agent，从内存会话存储和工作区记录中移除会话，并清理磁盘上的会话文件。用户可在菜单确认删除，也可调用 HTTP API；完成后客户端刷新会话列表。适合需要整理 DSH Web 历史会话的用户。需要安装到 web profile 并重启 DSH Web；不需要额外账号或 API 密钥。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:103-173","client.js:151-160"]}
{"unit_id":"fountunt__dsh-session-cleaner#card-en","repo":"fountunt/dsh-session-cleaner","commit":"f12ef7bad873638721b5b9891700d2c5e4df22f7","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-session-cleaner adds session deletion to DSH Web through an API and sidebar action. It removes sessions from the live store, workspace records, and disk, then refreshes the list. Install in the web profile and restart DSH Web; no API key is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:103-173","client.js:151-160"]}
